{{also|icecream|ice-cream}}
==English==
[[Image:Strawberry Ice Cream with Strawberries 01.jpg|thumb|right|250 px|Strawberry '''ice cream''' with strawberries.]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|ice-cream|icecream}}

===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:from|iced cream}}
Lexicalization of a reduced pronunciation of {{m|en|iced cream}} with regular deletion of ''-d'' before a cluster, from {{compound|en|iced|cream}}. Compare {{m|en|mash potato}}. Compare also {{cog|nds|Iescreem}}, {{m|nds|Ieskreem|t=ice cream}}, {{cog|de|Eiscreme|t=ice cream}}, {{cog|no|iskrem|t=ice cream}}.

