===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|Q13233}}{{lb|en|uncountable}} A [[dessert]] made from [[frozen]] [[sweeten]]ed [[cream]] or a similar substance, usually [[flavour]]ed.
#: {{ux|en|Strawberries are particularly delicious with '''ice cream'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|We were having chocolate '''ice cream'''.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1933|author=w:Frank Clune|title={{w|Try Anything Once (book)|Try Anything Once}}|location=Sydney|publisher=Angus and Robertson|page=71|passage=‘Do I pay you to stand there magging or to deliver '''ice-cream'''?’ the boss roared.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Amina Lake Patel|title=I’ve used the Ninja Creami Deluxe ice cream maker that’s all over TikTok for a year. Here’s my review|magazine=w:CNN|url=https://www.cnn.com/cnn-underscored/reviews/ninja-creami|date=2025-07-11|passage=There’s a good chance you’ve heard of the Ninja Creami by now. The original version of the '''ice cream''' maker has been around since 2021, but thanks to TikTok, it’s been one of the buzziest kitchen appliances lately.}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} A portion of ice cream on a stick, in a cup or in a wafer cone.
#: {{ux|en|Can I have some money for an '''ice cream''', Mum?}}
# {{lb|en|slang|uncountable}} The drug [[methamphetamine]].

